_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong-izumo:p002:m0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"桓氏","person_id":"tob_4dh_0fe","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":"cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:0cfd246d62c81533c379c68cc721666e16113417efb464ea7eafff6170379c70","source_layer":"received_biography","column_projection":[{"pdf_page":19,"half":"右","leaf":"十六下","column_from_right":2,"start":12,"end":18,"text":"年十七裴方明"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"右","leaf":"十六下","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"為子求婚酬許已定后夢見先有迎車至猶如"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"右","leaf":"十六下","column_from_right":4,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"常家迎法后不肯去次有迎至龍旂豹尾有異"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"右","leaf":"十六下","column_from_right":5,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"於常后喜而從之既而與裴氏不成婚竟嬪于"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"右","leaf":"十六下","column_from_right":6,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"上嚴整有軌度造次必依禮法生太子及豫章"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"右","leaf":"十六下","column_from_right":7,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"王嶷太子初在孕后嘗歸寧遇家奉祠爾日陰"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"右","leaf":"十六下","column_from_right":8,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"晦失曉舉家狼狽共營祭食后助炒胡麻始復"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"右","leaf":"十六下","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"內薪未及索火火便自然宋泰豫元年殂歸葬"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"左","leaf":"十七上","column_from_right":1,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"宣帝墓側則泰安陵也門生王清與墓工始下"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"左","leaf":"十七上","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"鍤有白兔跳起尋之不得及墳成兔還栖其上"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"左","leaf":"十七上","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"昇明二年贈竟陵公國夫人三年贈齊國妃印"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"左","leaf":"十七上","column_from_right":4,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"綬齊建元元年尊諡昭皇后二年贈后父壽之"},{"pdf_page":19,"half":"左","leaf":"十七上","column_from_right":5,"start":0,"end":14,"text":"金紫光祿大夫母桓氏上虞都鄉君"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong-izumo","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-liuzhirong-izumo"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002","text":"年十七，裴方明為子求婚，酬許已定，后夢見先有迎車至，猶如常家迎法，后不肯去；次有迎至，龍旗豹尾，有異于常，后喜而從之。既而與裴氏不成婚，竟嬪於上。嚴整有軌度，造次必依禮法。生太子及豫章王嶷。太子初在孕，后嘗歸寧，遇家奉祠，爾日陰晦失曉，舉家狼狽共營祭食。后助炒胡麻，始復內薪，未及索火，火便自然。宋泰豫元年殂，歸葬宣帝墓側，則泰安陵也。門生王清與墓工始下鍤，有白兔跳起，尋之不得。及墳成，兔還棲其上。升明二年，贈竟陵公國夫人。三年，贈齊國妃印綬。齊建元元年，尊諡昭皇后。二年。贈后父壽之金紫光祿大夫，母桓氏上虞都鄉君。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"裴方明","person_id":"l26_15v_yeo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:u0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"子","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"裴方明之子，本段未記其名。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:u0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"裴氏","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"原稱指裴家求婚一方。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"上","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"太子","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0090","start":90,"end":94,"surface":"豫章王嶷","person_id":"ijh_3fs_6u2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"宣帝","person_id":"egx_xax_4ic","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"王清","person_id":"ud8_x1t_413","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:u0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"墓工","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"與王清同下鍤，未記其名。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0231","start":231,"end":234,"surface":"昭皇后","person_id":"gm4_alk_hn7_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0241","start":241,"end":243,"surface":"壽之","person_id":"gm4_alk_hn7_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-liuzhirong:p002:m0251","start":251,"end":253,"surface":"桓氏","person_id":"tob_4dh_0fe","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段稱謂、親屬與互見紀傳。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":101,"last_line":101,"revision_id":2288359,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":6403,"raw_end":6683,"raw_character_offsets":[6403,6404,6405,6406,6407,6408,6409,6410,6411,6412,6413,6414,6415,6416,6417,6418,6419,6420,6421,6422,6423,6424,6425,6426,6427,6428,6429,6430,6431,6432,6433,6434,6435,6436,6437,6438,6439,6440,6441,6442,6443,6444,6445,6446,6447,6448,6449,6450,6451,6452,6453,6454,6455,6456,6457,6458,6459,6460,6461,6462,6463,6464,6465,6466,6467,6468,6469,6470,6471,6472,6473,6474,6475,6476,6477,6478,6479,6480,6481,6482,6483,6484,6485,6486,6487,6488,6489,6490,6491,6492,6493,6494,6495,6496,6497,6498,6499,6500,6501,6502,6503,6504,6505,6506,6507,6508,6509,6510,6511,6512,6513,6514,6515,6516,6517,6518,6519,6520,6521,6522,6523,6524,6525,6526,6527,6528,6529,6530,6531,6532,6533,6534,6535,6536,6537,6538,6539,6540,6541,6542,6543,6544,6545,6546,6547,6548,6549,6550,6551,6557,6558,6559,6560,6563,6564,6565,6566,6567,6568,6569,6570,6571,6572,6573,6574,6575,6576,6577,6578,6579,6580,6581,6582,6583,6584,6585,6586,6587,6588,6589,6590,6591,6592,6593,6594,6595,6596,6597,6598,6599,6600,6601,6602,6603,6604,6605,6606,6607,6608,6609,6615,6616,6617,6618,6621,6622,6623,6624,6625,6626,6627,6628,6629,6630,6631,6632,6633,6634,6635,6636,6637,6638,6639,6640,6646,6647,6648,6649,6652